      "context": "Current UI: tools/packaging/customer/support/NeuRotic-HubSettings.ps1",
      "control": "paragraph",
      "english": "Restores graphics state after injected rendering work. Automatic retains the existing default; select a manual value only for a known game compatibility requirement.",
