      "translation": "在注入的渲染工作后恢复图形状态。“自动”将保留现有默认值；仅在存在已知的游戏兼容性要求时才选择手动值。"
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: tools/packaging/customer/support/NeuRotic-HubSettings.ps1",
      "control": "paragraph",
      "english": "Restricts NGX interception to original NVIDIA library names. Change only for a known loader conflict; Automatic retains the existing default.",
