      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "选择此通道的可逆代理/合成路径。Soft-knee 是随附默认值；Neutwo 模式仍处于实验阶段。"
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "paragraph",
