    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "label",
      "english": "How much of the frame each half shows.",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.how_much_of_the_frame_each_half_shows_5fc04bcb",
      "line_breaks": false,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "两半分别显示多少帧画面。"
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "tooltip",
      "english": "How much of the frame each half shows.\n\nA half is half as wide as the frame and just as tall, so the frame\ncannot fill it and keep its shape.\n\nAt 1 the whole frame is there at its right proportions, with bars above\nand below. At 2 the half is filled and the sides are cropped away\ninstead. Anything between trades one for the other.",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.how_much_of_the_frame_each_half_shows_a_half_is__2be658cd",
      "line_breaks": true,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "两半分别显示多少帧画面。\n\n一半的宽度是帧的一半，高度相同，因此帧\n无法填满它并保持其形状。\n\n在 1 时，整个帧以其正确的比例显示，上方和下方有\n黑边。在 2 时，该半侧被填满，而两侧则被裁剪掉。\n介于两者之间的任何值都是这两种情况的折中。"
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "tooltip",
      "english": "How the model's work is brought back up when it ran below the frame's size.\n\nClassic composes the model's small picture directly against the full-size\nframe. Those two disagree by the shrink's blur as well as by the model's edit,\nand the composition cannot tell them apart -- it reads the blur as brightness\nthe frame has and the model never saw. The lower the model resolution the\nlarger that error, and it is the colour shift that shows up at 50%.\n\nMatched residual carries up only the model's difference and lays it on the\nframe's own proxy, so both pictures being compared are full size and the only\nthing that came from the small raster is the edit itself.\n\nNo effect at 100% or above: there is no residual to carry and the two are\nidentical (supersampling brings its answer down to frame size before this).\n\nFrom hhkbble's multi-pass work on this fork.",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.how_the_model_s_work_is_brought_back_up_when_it__62607e09",
      "line_breaks": true,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "当模型运行在小于帧大小时，如何将其结果带回。\n\nClassic（经典）将模型的小画面直接与全尺寸帧合成。\n这两者由于缩放带来的模糊以及模型的编辑而产生分歧，\n且合成过程无法区分它们——它将模糊当作帧拥有的亮度读取，\n而模型从未见过这些亮度。模型分辨率越低，\n这种误差就越大，也就是在 50% 时出现的色偏。\n\nMatched residual（匹配残差）仅携带模型的差异并将其放置在\n帧自身的代理上，因此被比较的两张画面都是全尺寸的，唯一\n来自小光栅的东西就是编辑本身。\n\n在 100% 或更高时没有效果：没有残差可携带，且两者\n完全相同（在发生此步骤前，超采样已将其结果缩小到帧大小）。\n\n来自 hhkbble 在此分支上的多通道工作。"
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "paragraph",
      "english": "How the model's work is brought back up when it ran below the frame's size.",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.how_the_model_s_work_is_brought_back_up_when_it__7d541b42",
      "line_breaks": false,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "当模型运行在小于帧大小时，如何将其结果带回。"
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "label",
      "english": "Hybrid composed: the best of both, and the one to use. Identity in the",
