    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "checkbox",
      "english": "Show the light meter on screen",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.show_the_light_meter_on_screen_11dd142d",
      "line_breaks": false,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "在屏幕上显示测光表"
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "tooltip",
      "english": "Shows the pass against itself, so the two can be seen at once rather than\ntoggled and remembered.\n\nSide by side puts the whole frame in each half, untouched on the left and\nedited on the right. Both halves are squeezed horizontally to fit, so it is\nfor looking at rather than playing in.\n\nWipe cuts a single frame at the split and resamples nothing, so the picture\nis the right shape and can be played normally. Drag the split below; it is a\nstored setting and stays put once the menu is closed.\n\nNeither needs the menu open to keep working. A hairline marks the join.",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.shows_the_pass_against_itself_so_the_two_can_be__822e02e3",
      "line_breaks": true,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "将通道与自身进行比较，因此可以同时看到两者，而不需要\n切换和记忆。\n\n“并排”将整个帧放入每一半，左侧未修改，\n右侧已编辑。两半在水平方向上被压缩以适应屏幕，因此\n它是用来观看的，而不是用来游玩的。\n\n“擦除”在分割处切割单帧且不重新采样，因此图片\n具有正确的形状，可以正常游玩。拖动下方的分割线；这是一个\n保存的设置，在关闭菜单后保持不变。\n\n两者都不需要打开菜单就能继续工作。细线标记了接缝处。"
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "paragraph",
      "english": "Shows the pass against itself, so the two can be seen at once rather than",
