      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "游戏自带的曝光值"
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "label",
      "english": "The game's own exposure -- read from the texture the game hands",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.the_game_s_own_exposure_read_from_the_texture_th_7cd3dfd9",
      "line_breaks": false,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "游戏自带的曝光值——从游戏提供的纹理中读取"
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "paragraph",
      "english": "The game upscaler feature is observable; this does not prove that NR inputs are qualified.",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.the_game_upscaler_feature_is_observable_this_doe_ad3c4062",
      "line_breaks": false,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "游戏的放大器功能可以观测到；但这并不能证明 NR 输入是合格的。"
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "paragraph",
      "english": "The measured native cadence met the target at the selected resolution preference. Untested routes are unmeasured.",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.the_measured_native_cadence_met_the_target_at_th_73a88cec",
      "line_breaks": true,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "在选定的分辨率偏好下，测量到的原生节奏达到了目标。未测试的路线均未被测量。"
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "label",
      "english": "The model was trained on finished frames where white sits at 1. The",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.the_model_was_trained_on_finished_frames_where_w_459eba8c",
      "line_breaks": false,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "该模型是在白点位于 1 的已完成帧上训练的。因此"
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "paragraph",
      "english": "The most the pass may move any pixel, as a multiple of what it already was, in",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.the_most_the_pass_may_move_any_pixel_as_a_multip_a98a4d7e",
      "line_breaks": false,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "该通道最多可移动任何像素的幅度，作为其原有值的倍数，可以"
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "tooltip",
      "english": "The most the pass may move any pixel, as a multiple of what it already was, in\nboth directions -- a pixel may not be brightened past this nor darkened past\nits reciprocal. Lights are where the model has least to say and rescaling its\nanswer does the most damage; 2x leaves detail intact while stopping a strip\nlight turning into a string of coloured cells. Raise it only if bright areas\nlook clipped.",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.the_most_the_pass_may_move_any_pixel_as_a_multip_dc109d72",
      "line_breaks": true,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "该通道最多可向两个方向移动任何像素的幅度（作为其原有值的倍数）——\n像素的增亮程度不能超过此值，变暗程度也不能低于其倒数。\n模型对光源的干预最少，缩放其结果会造成最大的损害；\n设置为 2x 可保持细节完好，同时防止条形灯变成一串彩色方块。\n仅当明亮区域看起来发生截断时，才提高此值。"
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "checkbox",
      "english": "The number runs the other way",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.the_number_runs_the_other_way_f51dcad9",
      "line_breaks": false,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "数字反向运行"
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "paragraph",
      "english": "The original image was preserved. Review the route reasons below and try another scene.",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.the_original_image_was_preserved_review_the_rout_fef0975a",
      "line_breaks": false,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "原始图像已保留。请查看下方的路线原因，并尝试其他场景。"
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "paragraph",
      "english": "The pass chain becomes active when DLSS Neural Rendering is enabled and ready.",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.the_pass_chain_becomes_active_when_dlss_neural_r_5f6c65d3",
      "line_breaks": false,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [
        "DLSS"
      ],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
