      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "白点来源"
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "paragraph",
      "english": "Wipe cuts a single frame at the split and resamples nothing, so the picture",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.wipe_cuts_a_single_frame_at_the_split_and_resamp_1cd7ad2c",
      "line_breaks": false,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "滑块会在分割处裁剪单帧且不进行任何重采样，所以画面"
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "label",
      "english": "Worth doing once you have decided which you prefer: the eye is not",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.worth_doing_once_you_have_decided_which_you_pref_a71a1786",
      "line_breaks": false,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "一旦您决定了更偏好的选项，就值得这样做：肉眼并不是"
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "tooltip",
      "english": "Writes which side is which onto the frame itself, so a screenshot still\nsays so after it has left this machine. Drawn into the picture's own\nplane: in the wipe the split reveals and hides the label exactly as it\ndoes the images, and there is nothing to drag. Swap sides moves the\nlabels with their pictures.",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.writes_which_side_is_which_onto_the_frame_itself_0115a956",
      "line_breaks": true,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "将哪一边是哪一边的标识写入帧本身，这样截图在\n离开这台机器后仍会显示。绘制在画面本身的\n平面上：在滑动分割时，分割线会像隐藏/显示图像一样准确地隐藏和显示\n标签，并且没有任何需要拖动的东西。交换两侧（Swap sides）会将\n标签及其对应的图像一起移动。"
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "paragraph",
      "english": "Writes which side is which onto the frame itself, so a screenshot still",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.writes_which_side_is_which_onto_the_frame_itself_9ce5af20",
      "line_breaks": false,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
