      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "控制器"
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/menu/menu_common.cpp",
      "control": "paragraph",
      "english": "Controls apply to the active replacement backend. Provider activity does not establish displayed frame delivery.",
      "id": "ingame.menu-common.controls_apply_to_the_active_replacement_backend_e7fdb9ac",
      "line_breaks": true,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "menu-common",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "控件适用于处于活动状态的替换后端。提供程序活动并不能确立显示的帧传递。"
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/menu/menu_common.cpp",
      "control": "paragraph",
      "english": "Controls how strongly sharpening is reduced across depth edges.\n\nHigher values more aggressively prevent sharpening across object boundaries (reduces halos).\nLower values allow more sharpening to pass across edges (sharper but riskier).",
      "id": "ingame.menu-common.controls_how_strongly_sharpening_is_reduced_acro_49743ae3",
      "line_breaks": true,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "menu-common",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "控制深度边缘锐化减少的强度。\n\n值越高，越能主动防止跨越对象边界的锐化（减少光晕）。\n值越低，允许更多锐化穿过边缘（更清晰但风险更高）。"
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/menu/menu_common.cpp",
      "control": "label",
      "english": "Controls how strongly sharpening is reduced across depth edges.",
      "id": "ingame.menu-common.controls_how_strongly_sharpening_is_reduced_acro_965fed7b",
      "line_breaks": false,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "menu-common",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "控制跨深度边缘降低锐化的强度。"
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/menu/menu_common.cpp",
      "control": "label",
      "english": "Controls sharpness at high contrast areas.",
      "id": "ingame.menu-common.controls_sharpness_at_high_contrast_areas_a23b00e2",
      "line_breaks": false,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "menu-common",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "控制高对比度区域的清晰度。"
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/menu/menu_common.cpp",
      "control": "label",
      "english": "Cope smarter, not harder",
      "id": "ingame.menu-common.cope_smarter_not_harder_ab9f08e7",
      "line_breaks": false,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "menu-common",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "更聪明地应对，而不是更吃力地应对"
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/menu/menu_common.cpp",
      "control": "label",
      "english": "Coping is strong with this one...",
      "id": "ingame.menu-common.coping_is_strong_with_this_one_8c12616d",
      "line_breaks": false,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "menu-common",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "这个很会硬撑..."
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/menu/menu_common.cpp",
      "control": "label",
      "english": "Corresponds to amount of accumulation added per frame",
      "id": "ingame.menu-common.corresponds_to_amount_of_accumulation_added_per__48f6baf5",
      "line_breaks": false,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "menu-common",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "对应每帧添加的累积量"
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/menu/menu_common.cpp",
      "control": "paragraph",
      "english": "Corresponds to amount of accumulation added per frame\nat pixel coordinate where disocclusion occured or when\nreactive mask value is > 0.0f. Decreasing this and \ndrawing the ghosting object (IE no mv) to reactive mask \nwith value close to 1.0f can decrease temporal ghosting.\nDecreasing this could result in more thin feature pixels flickering.",
      "id": "ingame.menu-common.corresponds_to_amount_of_accumulation_added_per__a71e0ab2",
      "line_breaks": true,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "menu-common",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "对应于发生去遮挡的像素坐标处或\n反应遮罩值 > 0.0f 时每帧添加的累积量。\n减小此值并将具有接近 1.0f 值的\n重影对象（即无 MV）绘制到反应遮罩\n可以减少时间重影。\n减小此值可能会导致更多细小特征像素闪烁。"
    },
    {
