    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/menu/menu_common.cpp",
      "control": "paragraph",
      "english": "Lets you override each preset's ratio individually\nNote that not every game supports every quality preset\n\n1.5x on a 1080p screen means internal resolution of 720p\n1080 / 1.5 = 720",
      "id": "ingame.menu-common.lets_you_override_each_preset_s_ratio_individual_7581c421",
      "line_breaks": true,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "menu-common",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "允许您单独覆盖每个预设的比例\n请注意，并非所有游戏都支持每个质量预设\n\n在 1080p 屏幕上为 1.5x 意味着内部分辨率为 720p\n1080 / 1.5 = 720"
    },
